I think it is better to implement backend in sglang without mindiesd dependency;

- **fp8 and mxfp4 quant modes**. CANN contains aclnnBlockSparseAttentionV3, plugin in sgl-kernel-npu is needed
- **mix quant mode**. Custom kernel could be added to sgl-kernel-npu, similar to `ada_block_sparse_attention`
